>**{c=red:After completing }{q:Beginnings|Beginnings|Beginnings}{c=red: you must zone before you can start this quest!}**
=2 Walkthrough
* (Wait one in game day since completing the last quest and re-zone into {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} if you haven't already.)
* Speak to {n:Waoud} to begin the quest.
* {n:Raubahn} will direct you to find and kill a {p:Flan|Category:Flan} in the {z:Navukgo Execution Chamber}.
** {z:Mount Zhayolm} {p:Home Point} #1 will place you just outside. Otherwise, {z:Mount Zhayolm} {p:Unity} warps (level 128 or 135) will put you close.
** **You do not have to be on {p:Blue Mage} to enter or complete this BCNM.**
* When in the {z:Navukgo Execution Chamber}, examine the Decorative Bronze Gate to start a BC fight.
** Up to 18 people can enter, but more people will cause more {m:Immortal Flans|Immortal Flan} to spawn.
** {p:Trust Magic} is allowed.
* Return to {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} and speak to {n:Waoud}.
* You will be given a {k:Sealed Immortal envelope}
* Deliver the envelope to {q:Lathuya|Lathuya|Lathuya} @ {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} F-8, on the second floor inside the stall.
* Zone into {z:Wajaom Woodlands} from {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (G/H-10 Stairwell), then head toward the south and zone into the {z:Aydeewa Subterrane} entrance at (K-9). There are no enemies in this small tunnel. __(There IS a {m:Phlebotomic Slug} on upper step that can be pulled, but will not aggro)__. Examine the unnamed target by the pond at (H-7) for a cutscene.
* Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and speak to Lathuya.

